  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "01 THE PROPOSAL"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Learning workshop proposal"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "Close looking with leaves"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Original decorative botanical study. The case records supply all assessed facts."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Fictional example for discussion • Date and funding not confirmed"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Proposed for a community-library learning coordinator: a 90-minute workshop for eight adult beginners.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Learners practise reasoning from supplied observations. They may read or hear the same records and…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Observable learning"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "O1 Record at least three precise observations without adding an unsupported assertion."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "O2 Compare one shared feature using accurate evidence from both records."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "O3 Replace an unsupported claim with a supported statement and a relevant unanswered question."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The proposal includes sample cases and a formative check. No workshop has been delivered and no learner…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "02 THE LEARNING SEQUENCE"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "A guided route to an independent attempt"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Planned duration: 90 minutes, including a five-minute break. Prepare separate A/B practice sheets and a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Two facilitators split the eight learners into four each for brief checks. These are planning windows,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "03 THE CASE MATERIALS"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Complete records and a worked model"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "These are fictional supplied observations. Do not infer species, age or the cause of a mark from them.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Leaf A for modelling and practice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The blade is 6 cm long. The edge is smooth. The tip is pointed. One round opening lies near the left…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Leaf B for modelling and practice"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The blade is 8 cm long. The edge has small teeth. The tip is rounded. Two brown patches lie beside the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Leaf C reserved for the independent task"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The blade is 5 cm long. The edge has rounded lobes. The tip is rounded. Two oval openings lie near the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Keep C and its task concealed until minute 55. If C was shown or coached earlier, use a fresh…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Worked response with A and B"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Claim to revise: “An insect made the opening in Leaf A.”"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Observations: A is 6 cm long; its edge is smooth; its tip is pointed."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Leaf A has a smooth edge; Leaf B has small teeth. Their edges differ."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Revision: Leaf A has one round opening near the left edge. The record does not tell us what caused it.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Why this works: the description uses A facts 1–3; the comparison uses each edge fact; the revision…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "04 THE EVIDENCE CHECK"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "A first attempt with a new record"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Using C and B, give three precise observations from C; compare their edge shapes using both records;…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Ready means this response meets this workshop criterion. Revise means an available response misses a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Capture the first attempt and retry separately"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "For each learner alias and criterion, retain the first response, status and access help. Then name the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Keep peer answers and model feedback away from anyone whose first attempt is pending. Arrange the same…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "05 THE DELIVERY DECISION"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Access and resources before scheduling"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Supply the same complete facts and task as readable text or verbatim reading, with repetition as…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Reading, repetition, transcription and access setup are allowed during the first attempt; content hints…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Confirm that two staff can capture the requested private responses in the planned windows. If more time…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Illustrative resource allowance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Subtotal USD 220 + 10% reserve USD 22 = USD 242 planning allowance. Rates are fictional assumptions.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Next decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The coordinator confirms the room, two staff, individual access arrangements and full funding before…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Caption",
      "text": "Design basis: align objectives, practice and evidence (CMU Eberly Center). Source and artwork…"
    }
  ],
